        {"src": "POK", "where": "POK_full.txt / POK_01-03", "stance": "silent", "note": "Searched for 'rose', 'Rose', 'rhod', 'wrod', 'rdh' lemmata and found no rose root. The only wrod-/wrad- entry is u̯(e)rād- 'root, branch' (p.1167), which is unrelated."},
