        {"src": "BRT", "where": "col. 1369 (BRT.txt l.22893, leaf 753)", "stance": "partial", "note": "'varəδa- m. 1) Mehren ... 2) Name einer Pflanze, vll. Rose ... Zum V. varəd- ... arm. LW. vard Rose; vgl. np. gul Rose'. Bartholomae attaches the word to the root vared- 'grow', not to IE 'thorn'."}
